Meeting summary for 4 February 2026:

  *

    *Updated: community meetup 2026*
    When: the weekend of 17 and 18 october, 2026 (decided by
    pollhttps://nuudel.digitalcourage.de/VnbRxE6iKdWECLbW)
    Where: Paderborn, Germany.
    Meeting room:
    Potentiallyhttps://www.welcome-hotels.com/en/hotels/paderborn/events/
    Beer: recommendation against local paderborner beer, although it is
    cheap.

  *

    *Updated: Release 2.7*
    We unfortunately had to deal with another issue so the stable
    release was again postponed.
    OpenVPN 2.7rc6 was released 28 January.
    The stable release 2.7.0 is currently planned for 11 February.

  *

    *Updated: Release 2.6.18*
    A small bugfix release is planned for today.

As always you're welcome to join at #openvpn-meeting on Libera IRC 
network every Wednesday at 14:00 Central European Time.

Kind regards,
Johan Draaisma

